  "name": "cartridges",
  "description": "Training and serving platform for journal cartridges: OCR fine-tuning of handwritten journals, a Task Store of questions, a vLLM Teacher on Modal that labels them, distillation of the Teacher into a trainable KV-cache cartridge, and a LibreChat gateway that serves Teacher or cartridge. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
